{"sym":"IREN","name":"IREN Limited","crypto":false,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Capital Markets","country":"Australia","employees":685,"website":"https://iren.com","exchange":"NasdaqGS","summary":"IREN Limited operates as a vertically integrated AI cloud services platform in Australia and Canada. It develops, owns, and operate data centers, including the associated land, grid connections, and substations, as well as buildings and cooling. The company also owns and operates compute layers, such as GPUs, CPUs, storage, servers, and networking deployed within that data center infrastructure; and software layers comprising managed services and enterprise support that enables customers to deploy, operate, and manage AI workloads. In addition, it is involved in Bitcoin mining. The company was formerly known as Iris Energy Limited and changed its name to IREN Limited in November 2024. IREN Limited was incorporated in 2018 and is based in Sydney, Australia.","ko":{"overview":"IREN은 호주와 캐나다에서 AI 클라우드 서비스를 수직계열화해 운영하는 회사입니다. 데이터센터 부지, 전력망 연결, 냉각 시설부터 GPU와 소프트웨어까지 직접 보유하며, 비트코인 채굴 사업도 하고 있습니다.","segments":["AI 클라우드 (GPU 임대, 관리형 서비스)","데이터센터 인프라","비트코인 채굴"]},"price":24.905,"prev":25.51,"mc":9814031360,"next":{"date":"2026-11-05","timing":"amc","ts":"2026-11-05T20:00Z","estimated":false,"eps_avg":-0.665,"eps_lo":-0.82,"eps_hi":-0.51,"rev_avg":221329820,"rev_lo":200017000,"rev_hi":244600000},"fin":{"rev":707006976,"rev_g":-0.267,"eps_g":null,"gm":0.6892,"om":-1.0247,"pm":-0.9938,"roe":-0.2341,"fcf":-4219297280},"val":{"pe":null,"fpe":-6.25,"peg":3.11,"ps":13.88,"pb":2.26,"ev_ebitda":306.62,"eps":-2.22,"div":0.0},"health":{"cash":5895590912,"debt":7839525888,"de":187.3,"cr":3.55,"short":0.2077,"short_days":2.3,"inst":0.6216,"insider":0.0652,"beta":4.27,"avg_vol":45512656},"analyst":{"mean":77.81,"lo":37.0,"hi":139.0,"n":18,"key":"buy","dist":[3,13,4,0,0]},"ret":{"1w":-0.0773,"1m":-0.4603,"3m":-0.3137,"6m":-0.5082,"ytd":-0.3406,"1y":-0.5195,"spy1y":0.1503},"vol3m":1.04